## psc/codegen/api.pengu — API pública de codegen F4.
##
## Recibe un `SemaProgram` ya comprobado por F3 y devuelve un `bundle.c` owned.
## No invoca el compilador C ni toca el sistema de archivos.

import psc.sema.modules.program as program
import psc.codegen.options as cgopt
import psc.codegen.context as context
import psc.codegen.bundle as bundle

insignia psc_codegen_api_

## Resultado de una emisión.
##
## ## Memoria
## `bundle` es owned; liberar con `free_result`.
rune CgResult:
    ## Emisión correcta.
    ok as bool
    ## C generado.
    bundle as string
    ## Mensaje de error (owned) cuando `ok` es `false`.
    error as string
    ## Estadísticas.
    stats as CgStats
    ## IDs de módulos con al menos una función viva (DCE).
    live_modules as vector of int

## Opciones por defecto (reexportadas para la CLI).
##
## ## Memoria
## Strings prestados.
weave default_options with base_dir as string into CgOptions:
    return calling cgopt.default_options with base_dir

## Genera C para un programa.
##
## ## Memoria
## Devuelve un resultado owned; el programa sigue siendo del llamador.
weave generate_c with p as ref to program.SemaProgram, o as CgOptions into CgResult:
    var c as context.CgContext is calling context.new_context with p, o
    var live as vector of int is vector of int
    var code as string is calling bundle.generate_bundle_c with (sigil of c), (sigil of live)
    var nlines as int is 0
    var b as ref to frozen byte is bytes of code
    var i as int is 0
    while i < code length:
        if ((b at i) to int) == 10:
            set nlines is nlines + 1
        set i is i + 1
    var st as CgStats is with types is c.catalog.types.len, prototypes is c.catalog.functions.len, functions is c.catalog.functions.len, instances is 0, includes is c.catalog.includes.len, bytes is code length, lines is nlines
    var total_errors as int is c.errors + c.catalog.errors
    var emsg as string is ""
    if total_errors > 0:
        set emsg is "code generation failed: {total_errors} unresolved compile-time condition(s)"
    # `code` se transfiere; el contexto no lo posee.
    calling context.context_free with (sigil of c)
    return with ok is (total_errors == 0), bundle is code, error is emsg, stats is st, live_modules is live

## Libera un resultado.
##
## ## Memoria
## Libera el bundle y el error.
weave free_result with r as ref to CgResult into void:
    banish r->bundle
    banish r->error
    banish r->live_modules

## Resultado de una emisión multiunidad (F7).
##
## ## Memoria
## Textos owned; liberar con `free_units`.
rune CgUnitsResult:
    ## Emisión correcta.
    ok as bool
    ## Cabecera compartida.
    header as string
    ## Unidad con codecs, runner y main.
    core as string
    ## Una unidad por módulo.
    units as vector of bundle.CgUnit
    ## Mensaje de error (owned) cuando `ok` es `false`.
    error as string
    ## IDs de módulos con al menos una función viva (DCE).
    live_modules as vector of int

## Genera cabecera, core y una unidad C por módulo.
##
## ## Memoria
## Devuelve textos owned; el programa sigue siendo del llamador.
weave generate_units with p as ref to program.SemaProgram, o as CgOptions into CgUnitsResult:
    var c as context.CgContext is calling context.new_context with p, o
    var live as vector of int is vector of int
    var parts as bundle.CgParts is calling bundle.generate_units_c with (sigil of c), (sigil of live)
    var total_errors as int is c.errors + c.catalog.errors
    var emsg as string is ""
    if total_errors > 0:
        set emsg is "code generation failed: {total_errors} unresolved compile-time condition(s)"
    calling context.context_free with (sigil of c)
    return with ok is (total_errors == 0), header is parts.header, core is parts.core, units is parts.units, error is emsg, live_modules is live

## Libera un resultado multiunidad.
##
## ## Memoria
## Libera cabecera, core, unidades y error.
weave free_units with r as ref to CgUnitsResult into void:
    banish r->header
    banish r->core
    banish r->error
    banish r->live_modules
    var i as int is 0
    while i < r->units.len:
        var u as bundle.CgUnit is (r->units at i)
        banish u.name
        banish u.text
        set i is i + 1
    banish r->units
